<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 177-3 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 177-3 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 177 for three , a lead of 266 runs, at tea on the fourth day of the third and final test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 177-3, South Africa 321</p>
